{'symbol': 'AZO', 'date': '2022-12-06 06:55:00', 'title': 'AUTOZONE 1ST QUARTER SAME STORE SALES INCREASE 5.6%;\xa0EPS INCREASES TO $27.45', 'text': 'MEMPHIS, TENN., DEC. 06, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AUTOZONE, INC. (NYSE: AZO) TODAY REPORTED NET SALES OF $4.0 BILLION FOR ITS FIRST QUARTER (12 WEEKS) ENDED NOVEMBER 19, 2022, AN INCREASE OF 8.6% FROM THE FIRST QUARTER OF FISCAL 2022 (12 WEEKS). DOMESTIC SAME STORE SALES, OR SALES FOR STORES OPEN AT LEAST ONE YEAR, INCREASED 5.6% FOR THE QUARTER.'}